rs' requests need approval. |"],[587,"| Variable                         | Default | Description                 |\n| -------------------------------- | ------- | --------------------------- |\n| `newUserDefaultShowQuotaEnabled` | `false` | New users get a show quota. |"],[553,"| Variable                        | Default | Description                                |\n| ------------------------------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `pendingWebhookCleanupInterval` | `60`    | Seconds between clean-ups of expired ones. |"],[585,"| Variable                        | Default | Description                      |\n| ------------------------------- | ------- | -------------------------------- |\n| `newUserDefaultMovieQuotaLimit` | `10`    | Movies allowed per quota period. |"],[584,"| Variable                       | Default   | Description                             |\n| ------------------------------ | --------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| `newUserDefaultMovieQuotaType` | `monthly` | `daily`, `weekly_rolling` or `monthly`. |"],[573,"| Variable                       | Default | Description                                    |\n| ------------------------------ | ------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `enablePlexPlaylistProtection` | `false` | Never delete content on a protection playlist. |"],[589,"| Variable                       | Default | Description                     |\n| ------------------------------ | ------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `newUserDefaultShowQuotaLimit` | `10`    | Shows allowed per quota period. |"],[588,"| Variable                      | Default   | Description                             |\n| ----------------------------- | --------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| `newUserDefaultShowQuotaType` | `monthly` | `daily`, `weekly_rolling` or `monthly`. |"],[551,"| Variable                      | Default | Description                                        